# AutoFS config for the server Flint
# Automatically mounts Flints NFS shares

# Written January 10, 2026 by walle
# Last updated April 30, 2026 by walle

# Flint

# Data
#Data -fstype=nfs,rw,nofail,_netdev flint:/mnt/Steel/Data

# HLSF
#HLSF -fstype=nfs,ro,nofail,_netdev flint:/mnt/Steel/HLSF

# Security
#Security -fstype=nfs,rw,nofail,_netdev flint:/mnt/Steel/Security

